OL,3,GNEWSAHow the beauty industry is
OL,4,Aboosting High Streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarie Campbell is sitting in the
OL,7,Fhairdresser's chair at the
OL,8,FWolverhampton salon she has been
OL,9,Fvisiting she since was a teenager.
OL,11,FNow 29, she is getting ready for an
OL,12,Fevent and she knows that salon-fresh
OL,13,Fstyle will help her feel more confident
OL,14,Fwhen she steps back outside later.
OL,16,F"People in the salon feel like family
OL,17,Fand people I can confide in, whether we
OL,18,Fare talking about day-to-day life or
OL,19,Fthings I'm going through," she says.
OL,20,F"It makes me feel settled down. Like
OL,21,Fthis is a safe place for me."
